        "content": "<h1>Group Reservations Walkthrough</h1>\n<p>The <strong>Group Reservations</strong> module has been implemented, empowering the Front Desk to handle corporate bookings, events, and block off multiple rooms at once.</p>\n<h2>What&#39;s Included?</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Groups Store</strong>: A dedicated <code>useGroupsStore</code> managing both the group details and the associated room blocks.</li>\n<li><strong>Seeder Integration</strong>: The <code>useDemoSeeder</code> now procedurally generates realistic group bookings with 5-30 guests each, along with various blocked rooms that are set as &#39;Blocked&#39;, &#39;Reserved&#39;, or &#39;Released&#39;.</li>\n<li><strong>Hydration Fixes</strong>: Added proper <code>localStorage</code> hydration during the app startup via <code>presidio.client.ts</code> ensuring that group data persists through page reloads.</li>\n<li><strong>Auth Flicker Fix</strong>: Upgraded <code>useDemoAuth</code> to utilize Nuxt&#39;s <code>useCookie</code> instead of <code>localStorage</code>, resolving a jarring issue where the SSR login page would flash before redirecting back to the dashboard.</li>\n</ul>\n"
